  "description": "REVWEU crystallizes in the orthorhombic crystal system with space group P n c a. Reported CIF formula moiety: C85 H92 N8 Na2 Nd4 O19. From the CIF bond table, Nd1 (Nd) has 6 O neighbors; Nd2 (Nd) has 6 O neighbors; Nd2A (Nd) has 6 O neighbors; Nd1A (Nd) has 6 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 5 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.811-4.021 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 99.53-114.48°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C85H92N8Na2Nd4O19.",
